WEBVTT

01:33.621 --> 01:37.962
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:38.089 --> 01:40.941
(Episode 1)

01:48.603 --> 01:49.802
(China Fire and Rescue)

01:49.976 --> 01:50.705
(Braving The Fire and The Danger)

01:50.872 --> 01:51.673
(Braving The Fire and The Danger, Always Ready to Fight and Win)

01:51.727 --> 01:52.201
(119)

01:52.261 --> 01:53.322
(Ready for Emergencies with Swift Action)

02:04.401 --> 02:05.121
Am I the only one late?

02:05.121 --> 02:05.561
Listen here,

02:05.561 --> 02:06.362
I'm the best at making dumplings.

02:06.362 --> 02:06.921
Yang,

02:06.921 --> 02:07.882
Did you wash your hands?

02:08.002 --> 02:08.921
What's the filling?

02:08.921 --> 02:09.762
Pork with chives.

02:09.763 --> 02:10.921
Wash your hands and go peel the garlic.

02:10.922 --> 02:11.522
Do you find me unhygienic?

02:11.522 --> 02:11.802
Quick.

02:11.803 --> 02:12.922
Do you?

02:13.601 --> 02:14.801
Ge, chop up your filling

02:14.802 --> 02:15.762
a little.

02:16.001 --> 02:16.522
Captain,

02:17.001 --> 02:17.922
in my hometown,

02:17.922 --> 02:18.922
we eat ham instead of dumplings

02:18.923 --> 02:20.121
at the beginning of the hottest season.

02:20.922 --> 02:21.961
In the north,

02:21.962 --> 02:23.160
we eat dumplings at the beginning of the hottest season

02:23.161 --> 02:23.802
and noodles in the middle period.

02:24.401 --> 02:25.481
Let's eat a lighter diet

02:25.482 --> 02:26.401
to remove the heat.

02:29.482 --> 02:30.401
I'm sure

02:30.642 --> 02:32.121
we'll have a hot meal today.

02:32.430 --> 02:33.202
There is no

02:33.281 --> 02:34.482
fire alarm yet.

02:35.681 --> 02:37.481
Shut your foul crow-like mouth.

02:37.482 --> 02:39.362
Stop jinxing it.

02:41.841 --> 02:42.922
What's wrong with crows?

02:43.001 --> 02:45.961
Crows are the most dutiful birds in the world.

02:45.962 --> 02:46.841
Enough.

02:48.281 --> 02:49.082
Where's the garlic?

02:49.681 --> 02:50.601
It's over there.

02:51.922 --> 02:52.281
Come on.

03:09.681 --> 03:10.482
Vascular forceps.

03:14.962 --> 03:15.522
Stop the bleeding.

03:26.642 --> 03:27.482
Vascular forceps.

03:29.441 --> 03:30.121
One more.

03:31.362 --> 03:31.881
Another one.

03:37.322 --> 03:38.242
Press the bleeding spot.

03:44.121 --> 03:44.642
Hold it.

03:45.281 --> 03:45.881
Suture.

03:56.802 --> 03:58.242
Hi, this is 119 Command Centre.

03:58.482 --> 03:59.161
(Hello.)

03:59.561 --> 04:01.922
(An asphalt truck overturned at Xinghua West Street.)

04:03.121 --> 04:04.841
An asphalt truck overturned at Xinghua West Street.

04:05.242 --> 04:06.522
Are there any people trapped at the scene?

04:07.082 --> 04:08.161
(Two people trapped in the truck.)

04:08.962 --> 04:09.642
Two people are trapped.

04:09.881 --> 04:11.401
Please leave your name and contact details.

04:11.681 --> 04:13.121
(My last name is Dong and this is my phone number.)

04:13.522 --> 04:14.680
Okay, we'll be on our way.

04:14.681 --> 04:15.762
Please keep your phone on.

04:17.601 --> 04:20.002
(An asphalt truck overturned at Xinghua West Street.)

04:20.122 --> 04:21.400
(Emergency rescue. Please send one vehicle from Squad One and Squad Two)

04:21.401 --> 04:22.281
(to depart immediately.)

04:22.401 --> 04:22.841
Let's go.

04:25.562 --> 04:27.002
Squad Leader, I'll eat the dumplings for you!

04:47.682 --> 04:49.283
(China Fire and Rescue)

05:13.682 --> 05:14.682
I'm sorry.

05:14.882 --> 05:15.562
-I'll wipe it for you. -It's okay.

05:15.562 --> 05:16.442
It's alright, Madam.

05:16.841 --> 05:18.321
Let me wipe it.

05:18.322 --> 05:19.360
It's okay.

05:19.361 --> 05:20.962
I'll take care of it myself.

05:21.682 --> 05:23.442
Dr. Xu, thank you for your hard work.

05:24.281 --> 05:25.122
Thank you for your hard work too.

05:25.401 --> 05:25.921
Don't mention it.

05:26.841 --> 05:27.801
Don't overexert yourself.

05:27.802 --> 05:29.002
Get more rest.

06:17.841 --> 06:18.762
Hi, Doctor.

06:18.763 --> 06:19.801
Please check on him.

06:29.481 --> 06:30.682
Which one of you is unwell?

06:30.801 --> 06:31.682
-Him. -Him.

06:31.683 --> 06:32.962
Come on, sit down.

06:34.241 --> 06:35.041
Come on.

06:35.642 --> 06:36.481
What's wrong?

06:36.481 --> 06:36.841
He...

06:36.842 --> 06:38.481
He has a toothache and it hurts so badly.

06:38.522 --> 06:39.449
(Xu Qin, Attending Doctor, Emergency Department)

06:40.962 --> 06:41.801
I can't treat a toothache.

06:41.801 --> 06:42.801
You need to go to an outpatient clinic.

06:43.082 --> 06:43.642
Outpatient clinic?

06:43.643 --> 06:45.161
The clinic is closed. What time does it open?

06:46.281 --> 06:47.241
Tomorrow morning at 8am.

06:48.921 --> 06:50.041
So we have to wait through the night?

06:50.361 --> 06:52.241
Doctor, we didn't make ourselves clear.

06:52.682 --> 06:53.881
He doesn't have a cavity.

06:53.882 --> 06:56.160
He hit his tooth on a mission and it hurts like hell.

06:56.161 --> 06:57.401
Please treat him.

06:57.801 --> 06:58.361
Yeah.

07:00.041 --> 07:00.361
Okay.

07:00.882 --> 07:01.962
Thank you, Doctor. Thank you.

07:06.682 --> 07:08.322
Come on, take off your mask.

07:13.361 --> 07:14.202
It's alright. Thank you.

07:15.401 --> 07:16.361
Why don't you want to get treated?

07:16.361 --> 07:16.601
Captain.

07:16.602 --> 07:17.762
Aren't you in a lot of pain?

07:18.082 --> 07:18.522
I'm sorry, Doctor.

07:18.522 --> 07:19.082
Thank you.

07:19.082 --> 07:20.002
-Thank you, Doctor. -Captain.

07:20.481 --> 07:21.401
Aren't you in a lot of pain?

07:48.921 --> 07:50.921
(Emergency Department) Captain.

07:51.122 --> 07:52.720
Since you're here, why not just let the doctor treat you?

07:52.721 --> 07:53.642
Yeah, just get it checked.

07:53.643 --> 07:54.762
Why don't you want to get treated when we're in the hospital?

07:54.841 --> 07:55.962
Didn't you feel a lot of pain just now?

08:13.721 --> 08:14.522
Jiang,

08:14.523 --> 08:15.562
isn't this the doctor just now?

08:17.682 --> 08:18.241
Yeah.

08:18.241 --> 08:19.202
Yeah.

08:19.203 --> 08:20.322
Why does she come after us?

08:28.202 --> 08:28.762
Let's go.

10:04.331 --> 10:06.331
(Shili Tai Fire and Rescue Station) (Job Transfer Application)

11:04.881 --> 11:05.721
Song Yan.

11:08.361 --> 11:09.322
Song Yan!

11:25.562 --> 11:26.481
Song Yan.

11:30.121 --> 11:32.001
Song Yan.

11:38.001 --> 11:39.481
Song Yan.

11:55.082 --> 11:56.961
I can't get the stains out of my fingernails.

11:56.962 --> 11:58.000
What's going on?

11:58.001 --> 11:59.282
It doesn't work.

12:01.202 --> 12:02.640
Toothpaste. Try it with toothpaste.

12:02.641 --> 12:03.840
Will toothpaste work? Give me some.

12:03.841 --> 12:04.721
Give him more.

12:05.001 --> 12:06.001
Enough. Don't waste it.

12:06.682 --> 12:07.241
Rub harder.

12:07.241 --> 12:08.082
-Rub harder. -Chi.

12:08.361 --> 12:08.881
Chi,

12:09.562 --> 12:10.282
try this.

12:10.641 --> 12:11.442
Toilet Bowl Cleaner?

12:12.361 --> 12:13.042
Are you kidding me?

12:13.121 --> 12:14.121
Isn't this for brushing toilets?

12:14.682 --> 12:15.601
This is a good stain remover.

12:15.602 --> 12:16.961
Try out anything we have here.

12:16.962 --> 12:18.401
Why should I?

12:18.402 --> 12:19.721
If not, the stains can't be removed.

12:20.042 --> 12:20.601
Chi.

12:21.322 --> 12:21.881
Chi.

12:21.881 --> 12:22.601
It won't work.

12:22.602 --> 12:23.881
Chi.

12:25.162 --> 12:27.240
I just searched online and there is a folk remedy.

12:27.241 --> 12:27.761
What's it?

12:27.761 --> 12:28.641
What folk remedy? Tell me.

12:30.082 --> 12:31.240
Boy's urine.

12:31.241 --> 12:32.561
It's said to be very effective.

12:32.562 --> 12:34.202
-Boy's urine? -Boy's urine?

12:34.442 --> 12:35.841
-Where can we get this? -Well...

12:36.121 --> 12:36.761
Who has it?

12:38.562 --> 12:39.202
Captain.

12:39.202 --> 12:39.962
Captain?

12:41.562 --> 12:42.721
Captain has never been in love?

12:43.962 --> 12:44.682
You've been here a long time

12:44.683 --> 12:46.361
and you haven't heard of the four rules of Shili Tai?

12:47.402 --> 12:49.042
Captain has never been in love.

12:49.282 --> 12:50.961
Instructor's girlfriend can hardly look forward to marriage.

12:50.962 --> 12:52.201
Jiang Yi is precise in jinxing.

12:52.202 --> 12:53.282
Jun Ping's muscles are well built.

12:55.402 --> 12:56.760
-Instructor. -Instructor.

12:56.761 --> 12:57.442
Instructor.

12:57.442 --> 12:58.042
Instructor.

12:58.042 --> 12:58.721
You startled me.

12:58.722 --> 12:59.961
Why did Captain pass on this bad habit

12:59.962 --> 13:01.202
of beating people behind their backs to you?

13:02.241 --> 13:03.162
If he finds out you're badmouthing him behind his back,

13:03.163 --> 13:04.520
he'll beat you even harder.

13:04.521 --> 13:05.322
Don't tell him.

13:06.202 --> 13:06.721
Where is he?

13:06.881 --> 13:07.721
He's in the garage.

13:11.322 --> 13:12.721
Use this. It works.

13:14.601 --> 13:15.721
Steel wire ball.

13:17.721 --> 13:19.402
It will rub off my skin.

13:19.962 --> 13:20.761
Try it.

13:20.841 --> 13:21.481
No.

13:21.481 --> 13:22.082
Try it.

13:22.082 --> 13:22.761
Stop it.

13:31.881 --> 13:33.841
What are you thinking about here alone?

13:35.241 --> 13:36.282
Is your tooth better?

13:38.721 --> 13:39.402
Yes, it's fine.

13:42.641 --> 13:43.042
Take it.

13:50.241 --> 13:51.881
Go to the dentist tomorrow.

13:53.322 --> 13:54.361
Come on, take the medicine.

14:02.202 --> 14:03.922
Drink slowly, don't choke.

14:20.641 --> 14:21.481
What are you looking at?

14:22.322 --> 14:23.322
Is there a word on my face?

14:23.721 --> 14:25.922
I think you have something on your mind.

14:27.202 --> 14:28.442
What could I have on my mind?

14:31.162 --> 14:33.082
We eat and sleep together every day.

14:33.761 --> 14:35.841
I can tell whether you have something on your mind or not.

14:57.391 --> 14:59.960
(119, Fire and Rescue)

15:00.601 --> 15:01.402
Zhan Da Peng.

15:01.402 --> 15:02.202
That's a failure.

15:08.881 --> 15:09.761
Zhan Da Peng.

15:11.282 --> 15:12.162
What's your problem?

15:12.162 --> 15:13.001
Pick it up.

15:13.322 --> 15:14.162
No!

15:14.521 --> 15:15.361
What's wrong with you?

15:15.641 --> 15:16.521
Pick it up.

15:17.241 --> 15:18.121
I would like to protest.

15:18.322 --> 15:20.841
We are here to be firefighters, not special forces.

15:21.042 --> 15:22.520
Are you trying to bully us newcomers into going through

15:22.521 --> 15:23.760
all sorts of training every day?

15:23.761 --> 15:24.881
What's your problem?

15:25.802 --> 15:26.601
Do it if you like,

15:26.602 --> 15:27.801
or get out if you don't.

15:27.802 --> 15:28.322
Pick it up now.

15:28.322 --> 15:29.082
No!

15:29.082 --> 15:29.721
Pick it up!

15:30.282 --> 15:31.442
-Stop it! -Will you pick it up or not?

15:34.442 --> 15:35.202
Zhan Da Peng,

15:36.121 --> 15:36.761
what's wrong with you?

15:39.241 --> 15:40.322
Report, Captain and Instructor.

15:40.962 --> 15:42.241
The training is too tough.

15:42.841 --> 15:44.240
Climbing the rope in 22 seconds,

15:44.241 --> 15:45.761
going up to the fourth floor with a ladder in 20 seconds.

15:46.322 --> 15:47.322
Our station's pass standard

15:47.323 --> 15:48.720
is higher than any other station's excellent standard.

15:48.721 --> 15:49.922
That's mission impossible.

15:51.881 --> 15:53.481
We're going through all sorts of training every day.

15:54.001 --> 15:54.881
There are also punishments

15:55.481 --> 15:56.442
for failing to meet performance standards.

15:56.682 --> 15:58.001
It's completely inhumane.

16:05.601 --> 16:06.402
Is that impossible?

16:09.731 --> 16:12.567
(Braving The Fire and The Danger, Always Ready to Fight and Win)

16:24.202 --> 16:24.922
Ready.

16:55.442 --> 16:56.481
19.88 seconds.

16:57.442 --> 16:58.241
What?

16:58.802 --> 17:00.001
19.88 seconds.

17:00.361 --> 17:01.760
This is not the best result of Captain.

17:01.761 --> 17:03.962
The record of 18.5 seconds

17:04.121 --> 17:05.081
in this category

17:05.082 --> 17:06.361
was broken by Captain

17:06.362 --> 17:07.362
in the previous year's provincial competition.

17:10.402 --> 17:11.202
Zhan Da Peng,

17:12.521 --> 17:13.481
take a look carefully.

17:14.281 --> 17:16.122
Everyone in the team has hands like this.

17:41.442 --> 17:44.281
This is a training ground, not a playground.

17:45.281 --> 17:47.122
Shili Tai never produces cowards.

17:50.281 --> 17:51.041
Report!

17:51.041 --> 17:52.041
I'm not a coward!

17:54.442 --> 17:55.321
Tell me,

17:55.962 --> 17:57.521
what is the duty of a firefighter?

17:57.882 --> 17:58.682
To put out fires.

17:58.922 --> 18:01.162
It is to rescue people from fires and dangers.

18:02.561 --> 18:07.682
You have to race against time and God of Death with strength, intelligence

18:08.162 --> 18:10.682
and willpower beyond the ordinary!

18:15.362 --> 18:16.922
You whine when you sweat a little

18:17.321 --> 18:18.922
and you get moody when you have a hard time.

18:19.602 --> 18:21.962
A loser like you is combustible when thrown into a fire.

18:22.241 --> 18:23.442
You can't even save yourself!

18:27.962 --> 18:29.162
You even cry when I tell you off.

18:30.567 --> 18:32.047
Can tears put out fires?

18:32.682 --> 18:34.001
Remember this!

18:35.162 --> 18:38.362
You have to be worthy of this uniform when you wear it!

18:38.721 --> 18:39.721
Yes!

18:39.721 --> 18:40.402
Yes!

18:46.241 --> 18:47.041
Keep on training.

19:05.241 --> 19:06.041
Hello.

19:06.606 --> 19:08.810
(Ms Xu, I am the property manager, Qi.)

19:09.402 --> 19:12.001
(There's a fire in Wufang Street right beside us. It's smoky.)

19:12.521 --> 19:13.882
(Keep your doors and windows closed.)

19:14.801 --> 19:15.842
(Don't be afraid.)

19:16.442 --> 19:18.402
(The fire started at the west end of the old street.)

19:19.041 --> 19:20.842
(It's quite a distance from our neighbourhood.)

19:23.402 --> 19:24.362
Anyone hurt?

19:24.761 --> 19:25.602
(I heard there are.)

19:25.882 --> 19:26.962
(Anyway, the fire was pretty big.)

19:27.321 --> 19:28.721
(The rescue team is on its way.)

19:29.226 --> 19:30.001
I got it.

19:52.362 --> 19:53.681
-Mum! -The ambulance is here.

19:53.682 --> 19:55.081
Mum, come here!

19:57.362 --> 19:58.281
Come here.

20:02.321 --> 20:03.561
Whose car is this?

20:06.481 --> 20:07.241
Whose car is this?

20:10.202 --> 20:11.402
Why is this car parked like this?

20:12.842 --> 20:14.761
Captain Song!

20:16.122 --> 20:16.842
Captain Song,

20:16.843 --> 20:17.921
this car is blocking the road.

20:17.922 --> 20:19.202
The owner cannot be reached.

20:19.521 --> 20:21.281
I keep calling him but no one answers.

20:22.521 --> 20:23.521
How far are we from the scene?

20:23.521 --> 20:24.241
Around 500 metres.

20:24.481 --> 20:25.442
Anyone trapped?

20:25.443 --> 20:26.602
There are still many people who have not come out.

20:26.962 --> 20:27.521
Hello?

20:27.922 --> 20:28.962
Okay, I'll be right there.

20:29.162 --> 20:30.402
Captain Song, I'll go with him.

20:32.281 --> 20:32.962
Turn this car over on its side.

20:34.001 --> 20:35.682
Shall we wait for the building to burn to the ground?

20:37.001 --> 20:38.442
Get down and turn this car over on its side.

20:38.602 --> 20:39.922
Captain, this is a sports car.

20:40.442 --> 20:41.321
-Do it. -Do it.

20:41.442 --> 20:42.442
I will be responsible if there is a complaint.

20:42.442 --> 20:43.402
Let's do it then.

20:44.001 --> 20:45.081
Quick.

20:47.481 --> 20:47.962
Hurry up.

20:53.721 --> 20:55.881
One, two, three.

20:55.882 --> 20:58.001
One, two, three.

21:06.962 --> 21:07.721
Get on our truck.

21:07.962 --> 21:09.081
Yes.

21:35.602 --> 21:36.162
Jiang,

21:36.241 --> 21:37.320
roll out water hose and ready to save lives.

21:37.321 --> 21:37.801
Yes.

21:39.402 --> 21:40.321
Find a water supply.

21:40.321 --> 21:41.081
Yes.

21:41.081 --> 21:41.721
Yang Chi,

21:41.722 --> 21:43.281
Get the new members to stand guard outside.

21:43.362 --> 21:43.721
Okay.

21:44.442 --> 21:45.281
Pi Pi, Ge, Da Peng,

21:45.282 --> 21:46.481
stand guard outside and set up a cordon.

21:46.561 --> 21:47.281
-Yes. -Alright.

21:48.561 --> 21:49.921
So we're here for nothing?

21:49.922 --> 21:51.442
When can we get into the fire?

21:51.602 --> 21:52.241
Don't even think about it.

21:52.362 --> 21:53.922
We can only do some basic tasks now.

21:54.001 --> 21:54.561
Let's get to work.

21:54.561 --> 21:54.882
Let's go.

21:56.402 --> 21:57.241
Everyone, please stay away.

21:57.242 --> 21:58.362
Please cooperate. Thank you.

22:14.761 --> 22:15.402
I'm...

22:17.122 --> 22:18.001
I'm a doctor.

22:21.001 --> 22:21.561
Follow me.

22:52.682 --> 22:53.521
Pi Pi, Ge, Da Peng,

22:54.041 --> 22:55.442
evacuate the crowd. Hurry up.

23:03.561 --> 23:03.882
Quick.

23:04.162 --> 23:04.761
Captain.

23:04.761 --> 23:05.721
What's the situation inside?

23:06.122 --> 23:08.122
The fire has now started to spread inwards.

23:08.281 --> 23:09.281
Large vehicles can't get in at all.

23:09.282 --> 23:11.721
I could only use two water guns to stop the fire.

23:12.041 --> 23:12.602
Besides,

23:12.603 --> 23:14.001
I also sent a rescue team inside.

23:14.442 --> 23:14.962
Okay.

23:15.162 --> 23:15.602
Li Bin,

23:15.882 --> 23:17.122
you are in charge of controlling the fire.

23:17.362 --> 23:19.040
Our team cooperates with the search and rescue.

23:19.041 --> 23:19.642
No.

23:19.882 --> 23:22.362
The building is already full of safety hazards.

23:22.481 --> 23:23.402
It would be too dangerous

23:23.403 --> 23:24.800
for a large number of people to go in

23:24.801 --> 23:25.761
and search the building in this situation.

23:26.761 --> 23:28.240
The houses in the area where the fire is now taking place

23:28.241 --> 23:29.681
are of brick construction

23:29.682 --> 23:30.882
It is not yet under control.

23:31.521 --> 23:32.442
Look at there

23:32.602 --> 23:33.442
and here.

23:33.842 --> 23:36.041
The two sides are all old wooden buildings.

23:36.162 --> 23:37.442
The air is low in humidity now.

23:37.682 --> 23:39.922
It will be too late once the fire has spread.

23:40.241 --> 23:42.682
By then, the affected area will be twice as large or even larger than it is now.

23:42.962 --> 23:44.642
It is highly likely to be completely out of control.

23:45.842 --> 23:47.362
I agree with the team going in to search and rescue.

23:48.481 --> 23:48.882
Okay.

23:50.442 --> 23:51.162
Be safe.

23:52.682 --> 23:53.721
Shili Tai, follow me!

24:18.721 --> 24:19.961
Stairs are blocked.

24:19.962 --> 24:21.321
The bottom roof is confirmed to be accessible.

24:22.922 --> 24:23.481
Over the wall.

25:16.882 --> 25:18.040
Back off.

25:18.041 --> 25:19.761
No huddles.

25:20.041 --> 25:21.041
Please back off.

25:21.042 --> 25:22.281
Please back off.

25:23.402 --> 25:24.442
Calm down.

25:28.122 --> 25:29.720
Get the person in charge here!

25:29.721 --> 25:30.402
Mister, Madam.

25:30.402 --> 25:31.402
Mister, Madam, you're not allowed in.

25:31.402 --> 25:32.081
Madam.

25:32.721 --> 25:33.682
It's really dangerous.

25:33.842 --> 25:35.682
Mister, Madam.

25:35.761 --> 25:37.481
We are concerned for your safety.

25:37.521 --> 25:40.122
Your location is too close to the scene. It's very dangerous.

25:40.162 --> 25:41.240
Can you please be understanding?

25:41.241 --> 25:41.882
Come on. Thank you. Please back off.

25:41.883 --> 25:43.442
Why are you so slow?

25:43.842 --> 25:46.201
We called 119 and it took so long for you to come.

25:46.202 --> 25:46.842
Mister, Madam.

25:46.843 --> 25:49.001
We... We arrived on the scene as fast as we could.

25:49.281 --> 25:50.962
You took a long time to get here.

25:51.402 --> 25:53.521
My house has burnt to a crisp.

25:54.642 --> 25:55.122
Here's how it works.

25:55.123 --> 25:56.961
Our response time is strictly regulated.

25:56.962 --> 26:00.080
We are responsible if there is any problem.

26:00.081 --> 26:01.081
Please back off.

26:01.082 --> 26:02.241
Please cooperate with us.

26:02.801 --> 26:03.842
Please cooperate.

26:09.761 --> 26:10.442
Dismiss, everyone!

26:10.443 --> 26:12.241
Ge, set up the cordon further back.

26:12.602 --> 26:13.720
Please cooperate with firefighters.

26:13.721 --> 26:14.442
Back off!

26:14.721 --> 26:15.442
Back off!

26:15.442 --> 26:16.321
Guys, back off! Back off!

26:16.402 --> 26:17.362
Song Yan,

26:17.761 --> 26:19.162
(what's going on in there?)

26:20.481 --> 26:21.442
A gas tank exploded.

26:22.081 --> 26:22.521
Why?

26:22.842 --> 26:23.561
Are you afraid I might die?

26:24.241 --> 26:24.882
(Don't worry.)

26:25.321 --> 26:26.642
(I can't bear to leave you alone.)

26:28.281 --> 26:29.721
Can you be serious?

26:34.682 --> 26:35.402
Instructor Suo,

26:35.962 --> 26:37.281
there are 50 to 60 households in there,

26:37.521 --> 26:38.642
each with a gas tank.

26:41.721 --> 26:43.201
Song Yan, lead the team downstairs immediately.

26:43.202 --> 26:44.601
Song Yan, lead the team downstairs immediately.

26:44.602 --> 26:45.842
(Please respond when you receive the instruction.)

26:48.922 --> 26:50.842
This is the last floor. We will withdraw after the search.

26:51.041 --> 26:52.760
(Song Yan, listen here.)

26:52.761 --> 26:55.122
The rooms in this building are all partitioned into small rooms.

26:55.721 --> 26:57.362
If every room had a gas tank,

26:58.122 --> 26:59.602
it wouldn't be enough even if you had ten lives.

27:00.321 --> 27:02.182
(I am ordering you, as the field commander, )

27:02.262 --> 27:03.483
(to withdraw immediately.)

27:03.721 --> 27:04.241
Roger.

27:04.602 --> 27:05.162
I'll withdraw right now.

27:14.521 --> 27:15.481
Song Yan,

27:15.642 --> 27:16.682
what's the situation inside?

27:16.801 --> 27:17.761
Cover them with water guns.

27:17.761 --> 27:18.281
Third floor!

27:25.882 --> 27:27.001
I found someone trapped.

27:28.561 --> 27:29.081
(Jiang Yi, )

27:29.082 --> 27:30.122
(go to the third floor to aid Song Yan.)

27:31.882 --> 27:32.842
Roger.

27:44.882 --> 27:45.362
Pliers.

28:05.442 --> 28:06.122
Go to the doctor.

28:20.041 --> 28:21.202
Song Yan,

28:21.442 --> 28:22.241
(are you alright?)

28:22.962 --> 28:24.362
The trapped person is rescued.

28:24.602 --> 28:25.362
Be careful.

28:25.962 --> 28:26.922
Have you finished searching up there yet?

28:27.081 --> 28:28.442
Two rooms to the west have not been searched.

28:28.642 --> 28:29.162
Leave it to me.

28:29.481 --> 28:29.761
Go down now!

28:29.922 --> 28:30.321
Okay.

28:37.801 --> 28:38.442
Doctor!

28:44.962 --> 28:45.842
Doctor!

28:51.521 --> 28:53.041
Doctor, how is she?

28:55.721 --> 28:56.362
She suffocates.

29:36.761 --> 29:37.362
Song Yan,

29:37.602 --> 29:38.521
get out of there!

29:39.122 --> 29:39.761
Withdraw!

29:47.081 --> 29:53.122
Mum!

30:01.321 --> 30:01.842
Don't be afraid.

30:02.162 --> 30:02.962
I'll take you out.

30:35.081 --> 30:37.897
Song Yan, what's going on inside?

30:42.561 --> 30:44.362
Song Yan, respond to me.

32:53.521 --> 32:55.162
Song Yan, are you injured?

33:08.761 --> 33:09.402
Song Yan!

33:25.041 --> 33:25.882
I was wrong.

33:26.281 --> 33:27.520
Sorry to have worried you.

33:27.521 --> 33:28.560
I'll be mindful next time.

33:28.561 --> 33:29.281
I promise.

33:29.721 --> 33:30.801
You disobeyed your instructor's instructions

33:31.041 --> 33:32.321
and seriously violated rescue procedures.

33:38.842 --> 33:39.602
Don't be like him.

33:40.321 --> 33:42.602
We need to brave the fire and the danger

33:43.241 --> 33:44.520
but good safety precautions are a prerequisite,

33:44.521 --> 33:45.151
got it?

33:45.202 --> 33:46.185
Got it!

33:46.281 --> 33:46.886
Got it!

33:50.162 --> 33:50.801
Yang Chi.

33:50.922 --> 33:51.362
Yes.

33:53.001 --> 33:53.642
Jiang Yi.

33:53.642 --> 33:54.001
Yes.

33:54.481 --> 33:55.081
Liu Jun Ping.

33:55.241 --> 33:55.642
Yes.

33:55.922 --> 33:56.442
Tong Ming.

33:56.642 --> 33:57.001
Yes.

33:57.362 --> 33:57.842
Gao Yu.

33:57.842 --> 33:58.281
Yes.

34:02.202 --> 34:02.922
Instructor,

34:03.402 --> 34:04.122
All present.

34:04.642 --> 34:05.922
Who turned my car over?

34:11.762 --> 34:12.481
Me.

34:13.001 --> 34:14.161
Your car was parked illegally

34:14.322 --> 34:15.121
and was blocking the fire escape.

34:15.442 --> 34:16.322
I just bought the car.

34:16.323 --> 34:17.401
How could you turn it over?

34:17.402 --> 34:18.362
How could you lay your hands on my men?

34:19.802 --> 34:20.681
I'm their instructor.

34:21.282 --> 34:22.201
You can talk to me if you have a problem.

34:23.041 --> 34:24.161
We cleared the fire escape

34:24.641 --> 34:25.722
in accordance with the relevant regulations.

34:26.121 --> 34:27.161
If you have any comments,

34:27.842 --> 34:28.521
you can go to...

34:28.722 --> 34:30.402
Do you know how much my car costs?

34:30.762 --> 34:31.762
How could you turn it over?

34:33.322 --> 34:35.601
Because your car blocked the fire escape,

34:36.201 --> 34:38.001
it took us an hour to put out a 10-minute fire

34:38.601 --> 34:39.641
and burned 28 homes.

34:39.802 --> 34:40.922
How dare you make such a fuss here!

34:41.962 --> 34:44.161
I would hide if I were you.

34:46.081 --> 34:46.601
Come on,

34:47.681 --> 34:48.962
give me your name.

34:50.442 --> 34:53.041
Shili Tai Fire and Rescue Station, Yanbei District,

34:53.962 --> 34:54.521
Song Yan.

35:06.641 --> 35:07.442
Just you wait!

35:12.842 --> 35:13.442
Alright,

35:13.442 --> 35:14.322
pack up and leave now.

35:21.521 --> 35:23.601
Do you know that female doctor?

36:52.722 --> 36:53.641
Is she a new student?

36:59.882 --> 37:00.681
Who let you in?

37:00.882 --> 37:01.442
Get out!

37:01.922 --> 37:03.442
I'd like to meet the new student.

37:04.282 --> 37:05.001
Get out.

37:05.762 --> 37:06.842
Lu,

37:07.081 --> 37:08.362
why are you so fierce?

37:08.722 --> 37:10.041
Don't scare the new student.

37:10.442 --> 37:11.601
Get out and stand still.

37:16.322 --> 37:17.442
Quiet, everyone.

37:17.962 --> 37:20.121
She is a new transfer student.

37:21.161 --> 37:22.561
Please tell us about yourself.

37:23.601 --> 37:24.362
Hi, everyone.

37:25.001 --> 37:25.962
My name is Meng Qin.

37:27.641 --> 37:29.282
What are your hobbies?

37:30.121 --> 37:31.242
I don't have a hobby.

37:34.362 --> 37:35.842
Then it's time for the question session.

37:36.481 --> 37:37.601
What would you like to ask?

37:42.962 --> 37:44.560
Which Meng? Which Qin?

37:44.561 --> 37:46.561
Meng, meaning the largest in ranking, and Qin, meaning infiltration.

37:47.481 --> 37:48.762
What a good girl.

37:52.282 --> 37:53.081
Song Yan,

37:53.962 --> 37:55.362
get back to your place!

38:37.601 --> 38:38.282
Let me introduce myself.

38:38.762 --> 38:39.722
I'm Song Yan.

38:40.442 --> 38:41.242
Yan, meaning flame.

38:46.121 --> 38:47.521
Why are you so quiet?

38:49.641 --> 38:50.641
Can you talk to me?

38:53.242 --> 38:54.041
Give it to me.

38:56.681 --> 38:57.481
Xu Qin?

38:58.041 --> 38:59.001
Isn't your surname Meng?

39:02.201 --> 39:02.882
Stand up.

39:05.322 --> 39:07.922
Good morning, Sir.

39:08.282 --> 39:10.161
Good morning. Sit down.

39:11.681 --> 39:13.922
Open to page 87 of your textbook.

39:17.882 --> 39:21.322
Let's think about the question we left in the last lesson.

39:22.081 --> 39:23.282
Xu Qin.

39:26.161 --> 39:26.722
Hi,

39:27.681 --> 39:28.481
I'm Song Yan.

40:22.601 --> 40:25.521
(Song Yan, I'm Xu Qin.)

40:27.686 --> 40:29.324
-(Long time no see.) -(Long time no see.)
